-- Reverse 0078 — drop the grace-window columns.
--
-- LOSSY only for in-flight grace state (a session mid-race at the exact
-- moment of rollback loses its "previous" slot and the next collision
-- for it reverts to the pre-0078 full-revoke behavior) — not lossy for
-- anything durable: no other table or read path references these two
-- columns, and `active_sessions.refresh_token_hash` (the row's current,
-- authoritative hash) is untouched.
--
-- `SessionsService.rotate()` (apps/api/src/auth/sessions.service.ts)
